sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Consumer
  participant K as Series cache
  participant S as Candle store
  participant G as Generation counter
  C->>K: get(symbol, interval, generation)
  alt hit, generation current
    K-->>C: cached parsed series
  else miss or stale generation
    K->>S: fetch rows
    S-->>K: rows
    K-->>C: rows, cached
  end
  G->>K: generation bump on new candle
  K->>K: invalidate precisely
